    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics was a subject that fascinated me in school—especially physics—but I never pursued it deeply beyond basic arithmetic due to limited opportunities. My father’s background suggests algebra wasn’t emphasized, and my own curiosity waned after high school. Now, I see its abstract beauty in economics and coding, though practical use is rare.",
